\f3\b\fs24 \cf0 Important detail to notice:
\f2\b0  every lambda captures 
\f5\fs26 node_copy
\f2\fs24  (a 
\f4\i copy
\f2\i0  of the loop variable) rather than 
\f5\fs26 node
